{
  "workflow": {
    "description": "To-spec for the Gold Band instances (issue #628, wave 4): turn the decisions the owner settled into a spec through question rounds. A run-start gate refuses the run when the repository rule or the family allowlist forbids a bound agent. Up to three question rounds follow, unrolled and capped at three: a round that leaves a question open pauses on its manual check for the owner's answers, then the next round runs; after round three the last check hands over to the spec regardless. The spec holds only decisions the owner answered. No shim node has a failure edge, so a failing gate ends the run in failure.",
    "version": "0.1",
    "id": "to-spec",
    "entry": "gate-to-spec-start",
    "control": {
      "max_attempts": 1,
      "max_rounds": 1
    },
